64-photos/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_03/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"605,477\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney with his Madame Tussaud&amp;#8217;s waxwork figure, 29 April 1964\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_03.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1964-photos/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_04/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTkxIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5MSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"191\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_04-200x191.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul McCartney with his Madame Tussaud's waxwork figure, 29 April 1964\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_04-200x191.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_04-580x555.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_04-960x919.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_04-768x735.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_04.jpg 1024w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"36975\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1964-photos/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_04/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_04.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1024,980\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney with his Madame Tussaud&amp;#8217;s waxwork figure, 29 April 1964\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_04-960x919.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1964-photos/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_05/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTkyIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5MiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"192\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_05-200x192.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul McCartney with his Madame Tussaud's waxwork figure, 29 April 1964\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_05-200x192.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_05-580x556.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_05-960x921.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_05-768x737.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_05.jpg 1024w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"36976\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1964-photos/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_05/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_05.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1024,982\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney with his Madame Tussaud&amp;#8217;s waxwork figure, 29 April 1964\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_05-960x921.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1964-photos/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_06/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_06-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Ringo Starr with his Madame Tussaud's waxwork figure, 29 April 1964\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_06-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_06-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_06.jpg 533w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"36977\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1964-photos/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_06/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_06.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"533,533\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Ringo Starr with his Madame Tussaud&amp;#8217;s waxwork figure, 29 April 1964\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_06.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1964-photos/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_07/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNjAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTYwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"160\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_07-160x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"George Harrison at Madame Tussaud's, London, 29 April 1964\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_07-160x200.jpg 160w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_07-464x580.jpg 464w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_07.jpg 750w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 160px) 100vw, 160px\" data-attachment-id=\"36978\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1964-photos/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_07/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_07.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"750,938\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"George Harrison at Madame Tussaud&amp;#8217;s, London, 29 April 1964\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/640429-beatles-madame-tussauds_07.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><p>In 1967 the museum lent the wax figures to artists Peter Blake and Jann Haworth to be used on the cover of The Beatles’ album <a href=\"/albums/sgt-peppers-lonely-hearts-club-band/\">Sgt Pepper’s Lonely Hearts Club Band</a>. Three of the heads –&nbsp;<a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a>, <a href=\"/people/george-harrison/\">George Harrison</a> and <a href=\"/people/ringo-starr/\">Ringo Starr</a> –&nbsp;used for the cover were rediscovered in 2005 after being lost for nearly two decades, and were auctioned for £81,500.</p><p>The Beatles’ changing image resulted in Madame Tussaud’s reworking the figures on several occasions throughout the 1960s.</p>\n<!--[googlesitekit-end-of-content]--><div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0 10px 0;\"><strong>Page last updated:</strong> 13 October 2017</div></div></div><div class=\"on-this-day-wrapper\"><h3>Also on this day...</h3><ul><li>2017: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2017/04/29/paul-mccartney-live-tokyo-dome-tokyo-20/\">Paul McCartney live: Tokyo Dome, Tokyo</a></li><li>2008: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2008/04/29/give-peace-a-chance-lyrics-to-be-sold/\">Give Peace A Chance lyrics to be sold</a></li><li>2002: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2002/04/29/paul-mccartney-live-gund-arena-cleveland/\">Paul McCartney live: Gund Arena, Cleveland</a></li><li>1997: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1997/04/29/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-cuthbert-amphitheater-eugene/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Cuthbert Amphitheater, Eugene</a></li><li>1993: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1993/04/29/paul-mccartney-live-busch-stadium-st-louis/\">Paul McCartney live: Busch Stadium, St Louis</a></li><li>1977: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1977/04/29/uk-album-release-thrillington-paul-mccartney/\">UK album release: Thrillington by Paul McCartney</a></li><li>1974: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1974/04/29/paul-mccartney-auditions-wings-drummers/\">Paul McCartney auditions drummers for Wings</a></li><li>1972: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1972/04/29/radio-john-lennon-yoko-ono-klos-fm/\">Radio: John Lennon and Yoko Ono on KLOS-FM</a></li><li>1971: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1971/04/29/interview-john-lennon-trinidad-express/\">Interview: John Lennon for Trinidad Express</a></li><li>1969: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/04/29/recording-mixing-octopuss-garden/\">Recording, mixing: Octopus’s Garden</a></li><li>1967: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1967/04/29/john-lennon-attends-14-hour-technicolour-dream/\">John Lennon attends the 14 Hour Technicolour Dream</a></li><li>1966: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1966/04/29/recording-mixing-eleanor-rigby-im-only-sleeping/\">Recording, mixing: Eleanor Rigby, I’m Only Sleeping</a></li><li>1965: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1965/04/29/filming-help-46/\">Filming: Help!</a></li><li>1964: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1964/04/29/live-abc-cinema-edinburgh/\">The Beatles live: ABC Cinema, Edinburgh</a></li><li>1962: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1962/04/29/live-star-club-hamburg-16/\">The Beatles live: Star-Club, Hamburg</a></li><li>1961: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1961/04/29/live-top-ten-club-hamburg-29/\">The Beatles live: Top Ten Club, Hamburg</a></li></ul><p>Want more? Visit the <a title=\"Day after day: the Beatles' history\" href=\"/history/\">Beatles history section</a>.</p></div><div class=\"gm-map\" style=\"position: relative;height: 390px; width: 100%;\"><iframe data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"about:blank\" name=\"gm-map-1\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/?geo_mashup_content=render-map&amp;map_data_key=2210f853017d570e3f96b96f696cef91&amp;height=390&amp;width=100%&amp;add_overview_control=false&amp;zoom=16&amp;enable_street_view=false&amp;map_type=G_HYBRID_MAP&amp;name=gm-map-1&amp;object_id=30330&amp;map_content=single\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none; overflow: hidden;\" title=\"Geo Mashup Map\"></iframe></div>",
  "textContent": "The London wax museum Madame Tussaud’s had unveiled effigies of all four Beatles on 28 March 1964. The Beatles were the first pop group to appear in the museum. On 29 April the band were photographed with the dummies at the museum.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nIn 1967 the museum lent the wax figures to artists Peter Blake and Jann Haworth to be used on the cover of The Beatles’ album Sgt Pepper’s Lonely Hearts Club Band. Three of the heads – John Lennon, George Harrison and Ringo Starr – used for the cover were rediscovered in 2005 after being lost for nearly two decades, and were auctioned for £81,500.The Beatles’ changing image resulted in Madame Tussaud’s reworking the figures on several occasions throughout the 1960s.\nPage last updated: 13 October 2017Also on this day...2017: Paul McCartney live: Tokyo Dome, Tokyo2008: Give Peace A Chance lyrics to be sold2002: Paul McCartney live: Gund Arena, Cleveland1997: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Cuthbert Amphitheater, Eugene1993: Paul McCartney live: Busch Stadium, St Louis1977: UK album release: Thrillington by Paul McCartney1974: Paul McCartney auditions drummers for Wings1972: Radio: John Lennon and Yoko Ono on KLOS-FM1971: Interview: John Lennon for Trinidad Express1969: Recording, mixing: Octopus’s Garden1967: John Lennon attends the 14 Hour Technicolour Dream1966: Recording, mixing: Eleanor Rigby, I’m Only Sleeping1965: Filming: Help!1964: The Beatles live: ABC Cinema, Edinburgh1962: The Beatles live: Star-Club, Hamburg1961: The Beatles live: Top Ten Club, HamburgWant more? Visit the Beatles history section.",
